<%- include('partials/head') %>

<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Discord server directory</p>
      <h1 class="hero__title">Let people find your server<span class="accent">.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero__lead">
        List your Discord server on a public board, get discovered by people looking for communities
        like yours, and receive sponsorship and partnership pings directly in your server.
      </p>

      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="<%= invite %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Add zenin to your server</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/browse">
          <% if (stats.listed > 0) { %>
            Browse <%= stats.listed %> listed <%= stats.listed === 1 ? 'server' : 'servers' %>
          <% } else { %>
            Browse the directory
          <% } %>
        </a>
      </div>

      <dl class="statline">
        <div class="statline__item">
          <dt>Servers in network</dt>
          <dd class="num"><%= stats.servers.toLocaleString() %></dd>
        </div>
        <div class="statline__item">
          <dt>Seeking sponsors</dt>
          <dd class="num"><%= stats.listed.toLocaleString() %></dd>
        </div>
        <div class="statline__item">
          <dt>Members reachable</dt>
          <dd class="num"><%= stats.members.toLocaleString() %></dd>
        </div>
        <div class="statline__item">
          <dt>Messages counted</dt>
          <dd class="num"><%= stats.messages.toLocaleString() %></dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="how">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section__head">
        <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
        <h2>Three steps, no dashboard gymnastics</h2>
      </header>

      <ol class="steps">
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__num">01</span>
          <h3>Add the bot</h3>
          <p>One click installs zenin. It greets your server and mints a permanent invite that never expires, so your listing link can’t rot.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__num">02</span>
          <h3>Run <code>/sponsor add</code></h3>
          <p>Describe your server and add a few tags. That is the whole form. Your listing appears on the directory immediately.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__num">03</span>
          <h3>Get discovered</h3>
          <p>People browse by topic and size, hit Join, and send sponsorship pings that land in your system channel.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt" id="features">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section__head">
        <p class="eyebrow">What it does</p>
        <h2>A directory bot, not just a bot</h2>
        <p class="section__sub">
          The directory is the point. Everything else makes your server worth joining once people arrive.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="features">
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>Permanent server links</h3>
          <p>Every server gets a never-expiring invite on join, so listings and share links stay valid indefinitely.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>Sponsorship inboxes</h3>
          <p>Pings from the site arrive formatted inside your own Discord, with the sender’s contact details attached.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>AI that learns your chat</h3>
          <p>Mention the bot and it answers in your server’s slang. It picks up abbreviations and running jokes from the room and uses them back.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>Levels and leaderboards</h3>
          <p>Members earn XP as they chat, with progress bars, auto-roles at level milestones and a full leaderboard.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>Giveaways by level</h3>
          <p>Set a minimum level to enter, so giveaways reward people who actually participate instead of drive-by accounts.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>Your key, your billing</h3>
          <p>Each server supplies its own OpenRouter key over a private DM. Keys are encrypted at rest and never shared with anyone.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <% if (featured.length) { %>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section__head section__head--row">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Largest right now</p>
          <h2>Biggest communities listed</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--sm" href="/browse?sort=members">See all</a>
      </header>

      <div class="grid">
        <% featured.forEach(s => { %><%- include('partials/server-card', { s }) %><% }) %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <% } %>

  <% if (fresh.length) { %>
  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section__head section__head--row">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Just listed</p>
          <h2>New on the board</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--sm" href="/browse?sort=recent">See all</a>
      </header>

      <div class="grid">
        <% fresh.forEach(s => { %><%- include('partials/server-card', { s }) %><% }) %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <% } %>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta">
        <div>
          <h2>Put your server on the board</h2>
          <p>Add the bot, run one command, and start receiving discovery and sponsorship pings.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cta__actions">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="<%= invite %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Add to Discord</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/dashboard">Server dashboard</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
